{"path":"io/basic_filebuf/swap","title":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_filebuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/swap","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Swaps the state and the contents of *this and rhs.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf\"><span class=\"kw1684\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_filebuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Swaps the state and the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>basic_filebuf</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is called automatically when swapping <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream\">std::fstream</a></span> objects, it is rarely necessary to call it directly.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ifstream\"><span class=\"kw1749\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ifstream</span></span></a> fin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test.in\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// read-only</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a> fout<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test.out\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// write-only</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    getline<span class=\"br0\">(</span>fin, s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// outputs the first line of test.in</span>\n&nbsp;\n    fin.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fout.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">//swap the underlying buffers</span>\n&nbsp;\n    getline<span class=\"br0\">(</span>fin, s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// fails: cannot read from a write-only filebuf</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// prints empty line</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns a <code>basic_filebuf</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_filebuf/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::basic_filebuf)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_fstream/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two file streams <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_fstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_filebuf","title":"std::basic_filebuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_filebuf<CharT,Traits>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Swaps the state and the contents of *this and rhs."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is called automatically when swapping std::fstream objects, it is rarely necessary to call it directly."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns a basic_filebuf object"},{"label":"std::swap(std::basic_filebuf)","note":"specializes the std::swap algorithm"},{"label":"swap","note":"swaps two file streams"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":129,"codeBlockCount":1}
